 w undertakings.\nSource: Ganesha Purana\; Mudgala Purana\nWhy: begin the s
 eason of vows by honouring the deity of thresholds and careful starts.\nMo
 dern angle: Community craft\, public art and shared vows\; cultural meanin
 g.\nEvidence: Cultural/psychological\nMore: https://saumya-sharma.github.i
